stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> AllocationPending
    AllocationPending --> Scheduled: allocates team
    Scheduled --> InProgress: assessor starts
    InProgress --> MobileComplete: field work ends
    MobileComplete --> SubmittedForQc: lead submits
    SubmittedForQc --> QcFeedback: sent back
    QcFeedback --> ReadyForCommittee: lead responds
    SubmittedForQc --> ReadyForCommittee: approved

    AllocationPending: Allocation pending
    Scheduled: Scheduled
    InProgress: In progress
    MobileComplete: Field work complete
    SubmittedForQc: Quality check
    QcFeedback: Quality check feedback
    ReadyForCommittee: Ready for committee
